er Non-Reportable segments. The company offers fortified food and beverages, health and dietary supplements, personal care products, and skin care and cosmetics, as well as management services. It also engages in the formulation of medicines; commercial lab testing; research, development, and experimental work on biotechnology, biochemicals, and bio-agricultural products; and open-source technology solutions. In addition, the company is involved in information technology (IT) advising and consulting; IT and customized software development systems services; trading in computer hardware and software; property investment and holding; plantation and cultivation of rubber trees and cash crops; production of toothpaste, soap, massage oil, shampoo, pressure cookers, tea infusers, diesel fuel additives, fruit and vegetable washing liquids, laundry detergents, kettles, air purifiers, home water filtration systems, bamboo salt, confectionery, biscuits, non-alcoholic drinks, spirulina and cordyceps cereals, natural organic food, and liquid coffee preparations; operation of a café, a glamping resort, and lodging facilities; trading in agricultural products; provision of aircraft chartering, management, logistical, and marketing services; maintenance services; aquaculture; renting of building spaces; forest plantation, reforestation, and mixed farming; grape and coffee plantation; online sales of tea, pre-packaged food, and beverages; marketing consultancy; general trading; agro-farming of mushrooms; marine sanctuary and other tour activities; and consultation and treatment services using ganotherapy. The company was founded in 1993 and is headquartered in Cyberjaya, Malaysia.","zh":"DXN Holdings Bhd. 是一家马来西亚公司，成立于1993年，总部位于赛城，提供健康食品补充剂，业务遍及亚洲、拉丁美洲、中东、欧洲、非洲、大洋洲和北美。公司通过健康与保健消费品、投资控股及其他非报告分部运营。","lines":["健康与保健消费品：提供强化食品和饮料、健康与膳食补充剂、个人护理产品以及护肤和化妆品。","投资控股：从事投资控股业务。","其他非报告分部：包括药品配制、商业实验室测试、生物技术研发、IT咨询与软件开发、房地产投资、橡胶树种植、牙膏肥皂等生产、咖啡馆和度假村运营、农业贸易、飞机包租服务、水产养殖、森林种植、在线销售、营销咨询、蘑菇种植、海洋保护区旅游以及ganotherapy咨询和治疗服务。"],"lines_en":["Health and Wellness Consumer Products: Offers fortified food and beverages, health and dietary supplements, personal care products, and skin care and cosmetics.","Investment Holding: Engages in investment holding activities.","Other Non-Reportable: Includes medicine formulation, commercial lab testing, biotechnology R&D, IT consulting and software development, property investment, rubber tree plantation, production of toothpaste, soap, etc., café and resort operations, agricultural trading, aircraft chartering, aquaculture, forest plantation, online sales, marketing consultancy, mushroom farming, marine sanctuary tours, and ganotherapy consultation and treatment services."]}}